<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-22T07:48:32.124Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:48:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks persist in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang. Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. Chinese nationals were arrested after crossing into Thailand from Laos and a Thai driver and a Lao man were detained for aiding them. The Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for military training, while Cambodia’s Hun Manet and Thailand’s prime minister set conditions for border evidence talks with former opposition leader Um Sam An. The WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative, and there were 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQcFhwSW4tR1VpYnN6VzZnb240cFlYNU51Y2c5aHVjemNEQno2UGZTZFVjTGgxeDh0Wjh2N01MM0JUejcxU2Y3UWhSTWt0ZTNMWllwSV9jdFF6aEE5c3N2YUViYWx2ZnJrZjhpbndKd3ZVSEFpMTlKeVNkREhEMGVDS25DbUNpYmxpd1pTTEFSdHlhNWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOM2xoOExmQUJKM1Q3ZTBGSnJGUVg1MkhjcW1zTVowVkdzd2ZQV3JBRHlrWUtId1ExX1lzLWtwaXlNVXFHbTFONkNmNHpibHBNOXMtbHBuOWRyVHM0SjNtU1YycVlBSW5YWnBKb01ya0hldU5BSVkxUFdkcDRyTWNLNG96clNfV3laWUtTbEEtNU16LW1QZ0dUaFozT2dsRUs5aHk1Skh6WU1MODhuaXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPcVdPbVlBcXlPNVh1SWdjNE51OEY0cUtCbkxMNkYyYm4zejBpX0R1UERfUkhUNEp4dEdWVVJjNHNQbGtaNWduWm92M0VoYUtYQTZ0dExkbWU0NmRGS2NTQ21hRzlQS1gxdF9haUhPMXNXV0VKdnZaSHB4QmF